  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_8
    value: <size=18>3 Free Games symbols on reels 2, 3, and 4 triggers Free Games.
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_9
    value: <size=17>Bonus symbols on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers the                           feature.
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: '<style=title><size=32><b>Free Spins Wheel

      </size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_2_1
    value: "<size=20>- When Free Games is triggered, the Free Spins Wheel spins\n
      \  once to determine the number of Free Games awarded. \n- The Inferno Wheel
      is made up of 10 slices of numbers that \n  represents free spins options."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_2
    value: '<style=title><size=32><b>Free Games

      </size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_2_2
    value: "<size=20>- 3 Free Games symbols on Reels 2, 3 and 4 triggers Free \n  Games.\n-
      Number of Free Games is determined by the Free Spins \n  Wheel spin. \n- During
      Free Games, 3 Free Games symbols on reels 2, 3, and \n  4 re-triggers free spin
      wheel.\n- Free Spins Wheel will spin once more to determine the \n  number of
      additional free spins."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_1
    value: '<style=title><size=32><b>The Inferno Wheel

      </size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_3_1
    value: "<size=20>- When                                      feature is triggered,
      the Inferno \n  Wheel  changes to include only the colors of the 15 randomly
      \n  awarded Inferno balls.\n- The Inferno Wheel spins once to decide the color
      of Inferno \n  balls user wins. \n- When the won Inferno balls includes a +1
      Spin, Inferno   \n  Wheel will spin one more time to allow an even greater win."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_2
    value: '<style=title><size=32><b>Inferno Inferno Balls

      </size></style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE_DESCRIPTION_3_2
    value: "<size=20>- Bonus symbols on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers\n   the                                 .\n-
      15 Inferno balls are randomly drawn from the Inferno \n   Machine. \n- 15 Inferno
      balls each reveals a prize.\n- Diamond Inferno balls award Jackpots. \n- Yellow,
      Red, Green and Blue Inferno balls award coin \n  prizes or +1 Spins.\n- The
      Inferno Ball Wheel spins to determine the color of   \n   the Inferno balls
      user wins.\n           - If the won Inferno balls include a +1 Spin, Inferno
      \  \n             Wheel will spins once more.\n- User wins the sum amount of
      all Jackpots and coin \n  prizes on the won Inferno balls. "
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT_2
    value: '<b><size=25>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SPECIAL_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
